{"fps": 30, "frames": 1592, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 137, "text": "In nineteen seventy-six, a man launched a fund built to be average.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 7, "e": 16}, {"w": "seventy-six,", "f": 21, "e": 50}, {"w": "a", "f": 51, "e": 53}, {"w": "man", "f": 55, "e": 62}, {"w": "launched", "f": 64, "e": 71}, {"w": "a", "f": 73, "e": 75}, {"w": "fund", "f": 78, "e": 87}, {"w": "built", "f": 89, "e": 96}, {"w": "to", "f": 97, "e": 98}, {"w": "be", "f": 101, "e": 103}, {"w": "average.", "f": 105, "e": 130}]}, {"a": 137, "b": 220, "text": "Wall Street called it un-American.", "words": [{"w": "Wall", "f": 139, "e": 144}, {"w": "Street", "f": 146, "e": 155}, {"w": "called", "f": 159, "e": 162}, {"w": "it", "f": 165, "e": 167}, {"w": "un-American.", "f": 174, "e": 197}]}, {"a": 220, "b": 371, "text": "Imagine you're Jack Bogle. You hoped to raise a hundred and fifty million dollars.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 222, "e": 235}, {"w": "you're", "f": 237, "e": 240}, {"w": "Jack", "f": 242, "e": 249}, {"w": "Bogle.", "f": 251, "e": 270}, {"w": "You", "f": 277, "e": 281}, {"w": "hoped", "f": 283, "e": 288}, {"w": "to", "f": 290, "e": 293}, {"w": "raise", "f": 296, "e": 299}, {"w": "a", "f": 302, "e": 304}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 306, "e": 313}, {"w": "and", "f": 317, "e": 320}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 322, "e": 327}, {"w": "million", "f": 334, "e": 343}, {"w": "dollars.", "f": 345, "e": 366}]}, {"a": 371, "b": 446, "text": "The bankers bring in about eleven million.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 373, "e": 374}, {"w": "bankers", "f": 375, "e": 386}, {"w": "bring", "f": 389, "e": 393}, {"w": "in", "f": 395, "e": 398}, {"w": "about", "f": 402, "e": 407}, {"w": "eleven", "f": 409, "e": 421}, {"w": "million.", "f": 423, "e": 434}]}, {"a": 446, "b": 517, "text": "You call it an abject failure.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 448, "e": 453}, {"w": "call", "f": 455, "e": 457}, {"w": "it", "f": 459, "e": 464}, {"w": "an", "f": 466, "e": 469}, {"w": "abject", "f": 473, "e": 487}, {"w": "failure.", "f": 491, "e": 511}]}, {"a": 517, "b": 617, "text": "The bankers offer to scrap it. You say no.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 519, "e": 521}, {"w": "bankers", "f": 525, "e": 535}, {"w": "offer", "f": 537, "e": 544}, {"w": "to", "f": 545, "e": 546}, {"w": "scrap", "f": 549, "e": 558}, {"w": "it.", "f": 560, "e": 565}, {"w": "You", "f": 578, "e": 583}, {"w": "say", "f": 585, "e": 590}, {"w": "no.", "f": 594, "e": 603}]}, {"a": 617, "b": 768, "text": "Critics call it Bogle's Folly. Rivals say nobody settles for average.", "words": [{"w": "Critics", "f": 619, "e": 631}, {"w": "call", "f": 633, "e": 635}, {"w": "it", "f": 638, "e": 640}, {"w": "Bogle's", "f": 645, "e": 658}, {"w": "Folly.", "f": 661, "e": 674}, {"w": "Rivals", "f": 686, "e": 697}, {"w": "say", "f": 701, "e": 704}, {"w": "nobody", "f": 711, "e": 720}, {"w": "settles", "f": 722, "e": 731}, {"w": "for", "f": 734, "e": 736}, {"w": "average.", "f": 738, "e": 754}]}, {"a": 768, "b": 841, "text": "So why buy a fund that can't win?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 770, "e": 773}, {"w": "why", "f": 775, "e": 779}, {"w": "buy", "f": 782, "e": 786}, {"w": "a", "f": 787, "e": 789}, {"w": "fund", "f": 793, "e": 800}, {"w": "that", "f": 802, "e": 805}, {"w": "can't", "f": 807, "e": 814}, {"w": "win?", "f": 818, "e": 827}]}, {"a": 841, "b": 972, "text": "You see, the market is one giant pizza every investor shares.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 843, "e": 846}, {"w": "see,", "f": 848, "e": 859}, {"w": "the", "f": 861, "e": 862}, {"w": "market", "f": 864, "e": 873}, {"w": "is", "f": 875, "e": 880}, {"w": "one", "f": 882, "e": 889}, {"w": "giant", "f": 894, "e": 903}, {"w": "pizza", "f": 905, "e": 917}, {"w": "every", "f": 921, "e": 928}, {"w": "investor", "f": 930, "e": 944}, {"w": "shares.", "f": 946, "e": 960}]}, {"a": 972, "b": 1111, "text": "Before fees, the average slice is exactly the market. That's arithmetic.", "words": [{"w": "Before", "f": 974, "e": 983}, {"w": "fees,", "f": 985, "e": 1001}, {"w": "the", "f": 1003, "e": 1006}, {"w": "average", "f": 1008, "e": 1015}, {"w": "slice", "f": 1017, "e": 1029}, {"w": "is", "f": 1030, "e": 1031}, {"w": "exactly", "f": 1033, "e": 1049}, {"w": "the", "f": 1050, "e": 1051}, {"w": "market.", "f": 1054, "e": 1071}, {"w": "That's", "f": 1077, "e": 1083}, {"w": "arithmetic.", "f": 1084, "e": 1102}]}, {"a": 1111, "b": 1248, "text": "But stock pickers take a bite first: salaries, research, trading.", "words": [{"w": "But", "f": 1113, "e": 1115}, {"w": "stock", "f": 1118, "e": 1127}, {"w": "pickers", "f": 1129, "e": 1138}, {"w": "take", "f": 1141, "e": 1143}, {"w": "a", "f": 1145, "e": 1146}, {"w": "bite", "f": 1147, "e": 1154}, {"w": "first:", "f": 1157, "e": 1179}, {"w": "salaries,", "f": 1182, "e": 1202}, {"w": "research,", "f": 1210, "e": 1223}, {"w": "trading.", "f": 1224, "e": 1237}]}, {"a": 1248, "b": 1351, "text": "Your fund takes a crumb, under half a percent a year.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 1250, "e": 1255}, {"w": "fund", "f": 1257, "e": 1266}, {"w": "takes", "f": 1269, "e": 1275}, {"w": "a", "f": 1277, "e": 1278}, {"w": "crumb,", "f": 1280, "e": 1298}, {"w": "under", "f": 1302, "e": 1305}, {"w": "half", "f": 1307, "e": 1312}, {"w": "a", "f": 1314, "e": 1315}, {"w": "percent", "f": 1317, "e": 1326}, {"w": "a", "f": 1328, "e": 1330}, {"w": "year.", "f": 1333, "e": 1339}]}, {"a": 1351, "b": 1454, "text": "So the average dollar chasing the market must trail it.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 1353, "e": 1355}, {"w": "the", "f": 1357, "e": 1358}, {"w": "average", "f": 1362, "e": 1371}, {"w": "dollar", "f": 1374, "e": 1383}, {"w": "chasing", "f": 1385, "e": 1394}, {"w": "the", "f": 1397, "e": 1398}, {"w": "market", "f": 1399, "e": 1410}, {"w": "must", "f": 1417, "e": 1426}, {"w": "trail", "f": 1429, "e": 1435}, {"w": "it.", "f": 1438, "e": 1442}]}, {"a": 1454, "b": 1592, "text": "The folly was never being average. It was paying to try.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1456, "e": 1458}, {"w": "folly", "f": 1461, "e": 1474}, {"w": "was", "f": 1478, "e": 1481}, {"w": "never", "f": 1483, "e": 1490}, {"w": "being", "f": 1493, "e": 1499}, {"w": "average.", "f": 1502, "e": 1515}, {"w": "It", "f": 1525, "e": 1527}, {"w": "was", "f": 1529, "e": 1534}, {"w": "paying", "f": 1536, "e": 1547}, {"w": "to", "f": 1550, "e": 1552}, {"w": "try.", "f": 1554, "e": 1575}]}]}